Runtime (not vendored)
----------------------

DeepSeek Harness
  https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
  Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek
  MIT License

  This plugin composes the public CLI and SDK wire protocol. It does not
  copy DeepSeek Harness source. `/dsh:setup` installs pinned npm packages
  (`@deepseek-ai/dsh`, `@deepseek-ai/dsh-sdk-jsonrpc-server`, and that
  server's published peerDependencies) into the user's plugin data dir and
  `cc` profile.

  The broker's run-to-idle loop in `plugins/dsh/scripts/dsh-broker.mjs`
  follows the published SDK client algorithm (`HarnessSession.run`: wait
  for the prompt's `agent/inbox/spliced` receipt, collect `session.event`s,
  stop at `session.status: idle`). That TypeScript SDK is not vendored.


