Mechanism port (reimplemented, not vendored)
--------------------------------------------

xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard
  https://github.com/xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard
  Copyright (c) 2026 xiaobright
  Portions Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek
  MIT License

  `plugins/dsh/scripts/lib/tool-bootstrap.mjs` reimplements the
  assemble-filter / per-session promotion protocol (bootstrap tool pair,
  `promoteOn: either`, suppressed context sources, fail-open to the full
  catalog) against this plugin's headless/cc `--patch` path.

  It is not a copy of that Web agent preset. Differences that matter:

  - no `dsh-agent-presets` install
  - no resident / `dev_tool_search` catalog (this plugin restores the full
    assembled Standard set after promotion — the Project2 98/99
    configuration)
  - sandboxed one-shot `tool-bash`, not persistent PTY bash
  - no `dsh-fs-local`

  Upstream NOTICE retains DeepSeek Harness Standard-preset copyright for
  their adapted preset YAML. This plugin does not ship that YAML.


